        <Param val="Hello!&amp;#10;In each trial, you will see the following:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A white circle (+) in the centre of the screen. &amp;#10;Keep your eyes on it.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The white circle will be replaced by a green circle. &amp;#10;As soon as you see the green circle, press the SPACEBAR once.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After your keypress, you will hear a beep. &amp;#10;The beep may come after a shorter or longer delay, and its pitch may vary.&amp;#10;After the beep, a response screen will appear. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Estimate the time that passed between your keypress and the beep, and type it in milliseconds. ( 1sec is 1000 milliseconds)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press the SPACEBAR to continue." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
